# 📋 PactDa Client MVP Checklist (Developer Portal)

## 🎯 MVP Goal
Build a world-class, inclusive, and globally accessible web application serving as the primary gateway for developers worldwide to join the PactDa ecosystem. Must successfully democratize access to trust infrastructure, provide comprehensive developer tools, and measure social impact across different cultures, languages, and economic backgrounds.

---

## 🏗️ Tech Stack Checklist

### Core Framework - **PRIORITY 1**
- [ ] **Next.js 14+** with App Router and Server Components
- [ ] **Tailwind CSS** with custom design system for global accessibility
- [ ] **TypeScript** for type safety and developer experience
- [ ] **Vercel deployment** with global edge network and multi-region support

### UI & Accessibility - **PRIORITY 1**
- [ ] **Radix UI + Shadcn/UI** with full accessibility compliance
- [ ] **WCAG 2.1 AA compliance** with screen reader optimization
- [ ] **Multi-language support** - next-i18next with RTL support for 20+ languages
- [ ] **Performance optimization** - Core Web Vitals with < 2s load times globally

### Analytics & Monitoring - **PRIORITY 2**
- [ ] **Plausible Analytics** (privacy-first) for user behavior tracking
- [ ] **Custom social impact tracking** for measuring positive outcomes
- [ ] **Error monitoring** with Sentry integration
- [ ] **Performance monitoring** with real-time metrics

